WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.520
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:05.650
Check it!

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.390
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.880
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.750
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.420
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.290
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.500
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.200
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.540
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.040
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.340
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.380
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.910
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.720
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.350
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.460
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.960
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.460
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.870
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.270
Fly up, angel

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:40.610
Come on, let's go.
It's not worth the trouble!

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.290
Don't you get it?

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.050
She's not an angel or anything else...!

00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:00.440
Besides, who knows
if she's even alive...

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.630
Come on--

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.710
Let's get back to the bus!

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:17.150
Hey, I said no...!

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:21.190
Shirley!

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:25.960
Gimme a break! Why do
I have to help her?!

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:32.440
We don't have the time or
energy to look after others!

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:37.600
It's like Big Sis keeps saying!
Forget anyone who's not a friend!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.910
I said stop!

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:54.830
You alright?!

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:58.520
Stay still! I'll pull us up...

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.200
Hey, Shirley! Quit moving!

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:35.100
This card has expired.
Please use a new card or insert coins.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.380
What the...?

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.550
Ouch! That's enough, you stupid thing!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:54.250
Warning. Please do
not damage the machine.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.520
Shut up!

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:02.120
Stop!

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:10.540
That's my bag! Give it back!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.810
Come on...

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.140
Hiyaaah!

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.300
Got it!

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:25.780
Damn it!

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.430
We're back!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.880
Welcome back, you two!

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:39.770
Did you stay here like I asked?

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.440
That shabby café is really useful!

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:46.840
One tiny modification and the
customers freak out about the coffee!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:52.610
Wow, you actually did it!
Not like that time you screwed up bad!

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:56.520
That was because you slipped
and fell in dog crap!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:01.820
Yeah! And right in the middle
of a crowded tourist spot!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.560
Some sightseers had to help you...

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:07.890
And then you cried after that!

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:10.330
You were so lame!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:15.570
--Oh, come on! It wasn't my fault!
--Eh? It wasn't?

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:18.070
--No!
--Sure it was!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:19.660
Now, now...

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.880
Got it.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:28.110
It's got a huge lock on it!
Must be something important inside!

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.810
Like wads of cash or jewels!

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.620
What is this?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.220
Who said there were jewels inside?!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:39.330
You did.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.090
Check this out!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.730
Whoa! It's loaded!

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:52.970
--Was he an arms dealer?
--He did look kind of shady...

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:55.540
Huh?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.600
It's pretty worn out.
Here ya go, Shirley.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:07.020
Couldn't we do even
bigger jobs with this?

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:11.120
I dunno... We haven't done
that kind of thing before...

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:15.090
I'm against it!
Only bad guys do robberies!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:21.730
Then we just rob the bad guys.
That'd make us the good guys!

00:06:24.470 --> 00:06:26.800
Huh? Is there something there?

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.000
Shirley...?

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:34.110
It's nothing. Nothing at all!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:39.650
Uh huh. It's another
cat or dog, isn't it?!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.350
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:49.760
It's grunting! What is it?
A pig? A gorilla? A snake?

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.990
Snakes don't grunt.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.430
I said no!

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:06.810
Where did you find her?

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:10.410
She was floating in the
river under the freeway...

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:18.990
Listen. As orphans, our only way
to live is to help each other out.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:23.020
This girl isn't one of us.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:28.530
Not again...

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:31.970
There's no such thing as angels or God.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.240
I wish there was, though...

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.480
Hey!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:42.280
Whose fault is it that we're bickering?!
Really, now...!

00:08:00.770 --> 00:08:02.870
What the...?!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.530
What's going on...?!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.520
What is that thing? Is it human?!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.890
This's bad, whatever it is!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.820
--What do we do?!
--Don't ask me...!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.270
Charlie!

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:36.330
Shirley! Are you okay?!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.640
Why, you...!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:42.640
Gimme the gun! I'm gonna
get revenge for Shirley!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:47.850
--Right! Now where is it...?!
--On the floor!

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:48.940
Found it!

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.860
She's...?!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:15.070
That's Shirley's! Give it back!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:44.140
Thanks, Daddy...!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.740
That's for watching the place
like a good girl.

00:09:46.740 --> 00:09:49.840
Sam. You'll have today off, right?

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:54.080
Actually, it looks like Peter
still won't be back...

00:09:54.080 --> 00:10:00.280
I see. But you shouldn't have to
fill in for him, especially tonight...!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:03.390
Well, here's our stop.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.580
Shirley! Hurry it up!

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:16.830
Damn it!

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:42.260
Now what are we gonna do?

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:45.360
We have no place to stay,
thanks to her.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:49.400
Why are we bringing her along anyway?!

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:53.340
--Shirley insists on it...!
--Guess it can't be helped.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:58.840
Who exactly are you?

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.980
--I don't remember...
--She is like this and all...

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:06.990
Hey, you know those awesome
moves you used in that fight?!

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:10.420
Was that karate? Or maybe kung fu?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.060
Fight...?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.860
Come on! It just happened earlier!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.660
I got it!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:23.840
You lost your memory when your
spaceship crashed on Earth, huh?!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:28.010
And that thing that attacked
our bus was a killer cyborg

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.940
sent by the government!

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:32.540
Right?!

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:37.500
Charlie, that's straight out of
that 'Galaxy Untouchable' show.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:41.790
I'm 'Galaxy Untouchable'...!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.950
Get real!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:56.470
Residents in the area have
reported that yesterday evening

00:11:56.470 --> 00:12:01.570
they heard children fighting,
as well as extremely loud sounds.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:07.050
There are children in these parts
who work for various gangs,

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:10.140
so they were probably fighting
over territory rights...

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.720
Did kids do that, too?

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:18.990
Maybe they used a
crane-carrying truck?

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:22.660
--Kids, all by themselves?
--That, I'm not sure about...

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:30.230
But even kids can turn into criminals
that put adults to shame...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:36.640
Once Charlie and I get the cash
from the register, it's your turn!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.510
Are you listening?!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:45.950
Make sure you stop them!
Otherwise, you're outta the group!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.620
Stop...?

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:54.630
Just kick butt if things get ugly!
Like you did yesterday!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.320
Ah...!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.400
Hand over the cash in the register!

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:08.040
This place is full of
counterfeit stuff, anyway!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:12.440
Good luck telling the cops
that your dirty money got stolen!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.710
You plannin' to hurt our business?!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:20.050
You're up, newbie!
Teach these guys a little lesson!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.610
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.360
Stop!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.850
What just happened?!

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:54.050
No idea! But we gotta get out of here!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.220
We're dead meat if they catch us!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.270
Damn kids...!

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:09.940
Thought you could get away, huh?!

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:12.840
--Big Sis!
--I'm sorry...!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.070
Why, you little...!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:45.200
One boy, and four girls...

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.110
One of them had silver hair?

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.340
Yeah... She was no ordinary kid!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:54.740
Yeah! <i>We're</i> the victims here!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:03.180
Yeah, alright. Have some cookies
ready next time little kids attack.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:23.580
Lover. Have you determined
the target's location?

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.610
We react to each other
when within a certain distance.

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.750
You needn't worry.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:34.520
Now you can make up for
that final test error.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:37.110
You're a perfect candidate.

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:43.990
The pain is from cellular fusion.
It'll go away shortly.

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:57.210
<i>There will be no escape this time...!</i>

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:11.320
Now what?!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:15.690
We haven't even stolen a dollar
and now we're fugitives!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:19.630
This is goodbye! Get out of here!

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.940
Shirley...!

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:31.970
You can leave too.

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:39.820
Please, Big Sis! Let her stay with us!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:43.520
She's like us! She can't
survive on her own!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.760
She did help us out of
that close call today...

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.420
She could be helpful later on, too...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:53.700
What's your name...?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.830
I forget.

00:16:55.830 --> 00:17:01.070
Fine! I'll start by
teaching you the ropes for now.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.980
Too late...!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:10.850
She's here!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:22.530
This is Car #55.

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:27.300
Gunfire in East Side, C Block.
Proceed to site immediately.

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.390
Asian Town! Step on it!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.540
I will not lose...

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.340
I will win!

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:50.320
There! Stop the car!

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:59.060
What is it?!

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.160
Will she be alright?

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.940
Don't tell me she's--

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.450
Charlie! Dorothy!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:17.080
Get outside! And don't
let Shirley get hurt!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.680
What are you gonna do?!

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.280
Help her out with this!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:29.320
What the heck's going on in there?
Doesn't anyone know?!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.500
Look out!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.730
Charlie! Shirley!

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:44.540
That bad guy from the café!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:47.070
Bad guy?! I'm a cop...!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.520
What did you kids do with that gun?

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:55.090
Our 'Big Sis' has it.
She's fighting together inside!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:58.180
--Who with?!
--Galaxy Untouchable!

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:07.160
I'm going to crack your skull open
and rip out your brain!

00:19:08.430 --> 00:19:11.770
Let my friend go, you freak!

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:37.090
So Number 2 did survive...

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:18.270
Where do you think they went...?

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:24.000
It's like everything these
past two days was an illusion...

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:29.050
Yeah...

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.780
I feel the same way.

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.880
Do you like that doll?

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:39.990
You must be hungry.
How about some burgers?

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.800
Why aren't you going?

00:20:54.340 --> 00:21:02.770
I just get the feeling they'd be
better off with him than with me...

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:09.220
Plus, I have a new partner!

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:11.420
--Partner...?
--Yeah!

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:17.190
I really looked out for you,
so you gotta work off your debt to me!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:22.230
Oh yeah, I still haven't
told you my name.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:24.840
I'm Meg. How about you?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:29.670
Oh yeah, you lost your memory...

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.200
No, I remember now.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:34.910
I'm Jo.

00:21:56.310 --> 00:22:03.980
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:11.620
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:19.330
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:28.700
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:35.240
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:44.250
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:51.090
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.550 --> 00:23:15.550
<i>In the dazzling sunlight,
Mother Nature's anger</i>

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:18.450
<i>suddenly appears before
the relaxing heroes.</i>

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.890
<i>Look out, Jo!</i>

00:23:19.890 --> 00:23:25.050
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"An Ocean, Swimsuits, and a Sea Monster"
